    {
      "_id": "2SmwiBk9nO7O0xM3",
      "name": "Despair",
      "type": "specialAbility",
      "img": "systems/modern20/assets/icons/lorc/magic-swirl.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>At the mere sight of a mummy, the viewer must succeed on a @Check[save:will|dc:15]{Will save (DC 15)} or be paralyzed with fear for 1d4 rounds. Whether or not the save is successful, that creature cannot be affected again by that mummy’s despair ability for one day.</p>",
        "source": "d20 Modern SRD",
        "srdUrl": "https://spellbooksoftware.com/d20mrsd/creatures2.html",
        "rulesPage": "Compendium.modern20.rules.JournalEntry.y98NYAYGT9GM5Mox.JournalEntryPage.Gz87IPdigtsYQV9G",
        "abilityType": "supernatural",
        "sense": false,
        "activities": {}
      },
      "_key": "!actors.items!ddGYoiNM3F7cXbTQ.2SmwiBk9nO7O0xM3"
    },
    {
      "_id": "xDqmoWhwFV6PDcO5",
      "name": "Mummy Rot",
      "type": "specialAbility",
      "img": "systems/modern20/assets/icons/lorc/vomiting.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>A mummy’s touch carries a horrible rotting disease (Fort save DC 20 negates; incubation period 1 day; damage 1d6 temporary Constitution). The GM may allow characters to create medicine to treat the disease using the Craft (pharmaceutical) skill. In a campaign that uses magic, a remove disease spell can cure this disease. The only other way to halt the disease’s advance is to amputate whatever appendage the mummy touched (usually a hand, arm, leg, or foot). Amputating a limb deals 1d4+1 points of temporary Constitution damage, although a successful @Check[skill:treatInjury|dc:25]{Treat Injury check (DC 25)} reduces the temporary Constitution damage to 1 point.</p><p>An afflicted creature that dies of mummy rot shrivels away and turns to dust.</p>",
        "source": "d20 Modern SRD",
        "srdUrl": "https://spellbooksoftware.com/d20mrsd/creatures2.html",
        "rulesPage": "Compendium.modern20.rules.JournalEntry.y98NYAYGT9GM5Mox.JournalEntryPage.Duxf6x7GStPBDNHg",
        "abilityType": "supernatural",
        "sense": false,
        "activities": {}
      },
      "_key": "!actors.items!ddGYoiNM3F7cXbTQ.xDqmoWhwFV6PDcO5"
    },
    {
      "_id": "jWy3dKci6q8kV3EX",
      "name": "Fire Vulnerability",
      "type": "specialAbility",
      "img": "systems/modern20/assets/icons/carl-olsen/flame.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>A mummy takes double damage from fire attacks unless a save is allowed for half damage. A successful save halves the damage, and a failure doubles it.</p>",
        "source": "d20 Modern SRD",
        "srdUrl": "https://spellbooksoftware.com/d20mrsd/creatures2.html",
        "rulesPage": "Compendium.modern20.rules.JournalEntry.y98NYAYGT9GM5Mox.JournalEntryPage.Gz87IPdigtsYQV9G",
